WEBVTT

01:40.110 --> 01:43.000
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.130 --> 01:45.979
[Episode 22]

02:16.120 --> 02:17.890
She is the murderer.

02:24.890 --> 02:26.720
So Ms. Wen Xiao is not a demon.

02:41.070 --> 02:41.790
He's here.

02:41.829 --> 02:42.700
Brother Zhuo!

02:43.660 --> 02:44.570
Mr. Zhuo!

02:44.630 --> 02:45.670
Wake up!

02:45.690 --> 02:46.850
Where is Ao Yin?

02:47.390 --> 02:48.050
She ran away.

02:48.050 --> 02:48.740
She ran away!

02:48.740 --> 02:49.340
After her!

02:49.350 --> 02:49.750
After her!

02:49.750 --> 02:50.350
After her!

03:00.110 --> 03:01.640
Jiu, slow down.

03:01.680 --> 03:03.030
Ying Lei, stop yelling.

03:03.050 --> 03:04.940
Whose stairs are so...

03:09.830 --> 03:10.690
Where is Ao Yin?

03:12.440 --> 03:13.960
She escaped.

03:14.830 --> 03:15.310
I didn't expect that

03:15.310 --> 03:17.190
the Huanling Powder mixed with the Kusnezoff Monkshood Root

03:17.190 --> 03:18.579
still doesn't work.

03:18.700 --> 03:19.850
What should we do?

03:20.079 --> 03:21.890
Although we didn't catch Ao Yin,

03:21.950 --> 03:23.160
we have successfully

03:23.350 --> 03:23.860
forced her to transform

03:23.860 --> 03:25.710
in public many times.

03:25.950 --> 03:27.270
So many people in Tianxiang Pavilion

03:27.270 --> 03:28.660
saw it with their own eyes

03:28.660 --> 03:30.910
that Ao Yin is a demon who can transform

03:31.030 --> 03:32.950
into a human and bewitch people.

03:32.980 --> 03:33.470
Yes.

03:33.829 --> 03:35.160
Her biggest mistake was

03:35.190 --> 03:36.890
she transformed into Wen.

03:36.980 --> 03:38.860
Everyone there can prove it.

03:38.890 --> 03:40.390
The Prime Minister's death

03:40.390 --> 03:41.950
is clearly beyond human capability.

03:41.950 --> 03:43.070
The evidence should be enough

03:43.070 --> 03:44.710
to clear Wen of suspicion.

03:57.079 --> 03:57.880
Brother Zhuo?

04:13.230 --> 04:14.190
Wen Xiao.

04:14.910 --> 04:15.870
Father.

04:16.670 --> 04:17.649
Wen Xiao.

04:17.790 --> 04:18.820
Are you alright?

04:19.310 --> 04:21.170
Wen Zongyu finally released you.

04:21.190 --> 04:21.920
Father,

04:22.310 --> 04:23.070
I'm fine.

04:23.630 --> 04:24.700
We have witnesses.

04:24.720 --> 04:26.320
They had to release me.

04:27.030 --> 04:28.130
But Sister Pei

04:28.390 --> 04:30.120
is still in Wen Zongyu's hands.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.960
You go take a rest first.

04:32.110 --> 04:33.670
I'll figure out a way to save her.

04:33.670 --> 04:34.620
There is a way.

04:34.830 --> 04:36.630
Sister Pei has figured out a way.

04:36.920 --> 04:37.730
Zhuo,

04:37.990 --> 04:39.250
go to the Chongwu Camp.

05:01.530 --> 05:03.470
Have you brought what I want?

05:06.420 --> 05:07.620
If I die,

05:09.740 --> 05:11.960
your research on demonized humans

05:13.160 --> 05:14.720
can no longer stay hidden.

05:17.380 --> 05:20.340
You should know Cheng Huang's magical instrument

05:20.550 --> 05:22.480
can store memories.

05:23.770 --> 05:25.360
Zhao Yuanzhou and I

05:25.640 --> 05:28.800
have already stored everything that happened in the dungeon

05:28.800 --> 05:30.850
in the sundial

05:31.080 --> 05:32.560
and given it to Mr. Situ.

05:35.990 --> 05:36.990
You go first.

05:41.540 --> 05:42.650
Be careful.

06:37.610 --> 06:38.670
What do we eat?

06:39.909 --> 06:40.750
Mr. Zhuo,

06:40.909 --> 06:42.840
do you want to go somewhere to play?

06:46.080 --> 06:46.700
Jiu.

06:46.920 --> 06:47.540
Jiu.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.630
Come here.

07:16.590 --> 07:18.990
Are you still worried about Zhao Yuanzhou?

07:20.150 --> 07:21.550
It's been a day.

07:22.590 --> 07:24.600
I wonder if he's okay

07:25.510 --> 07:26.590
or conscious.

07:34.190 --> 07:35.330
No news

07:35.400 --> 07:36.710
is good news.

07:41.620 --> 07:43.590
What should we do next?

07:50.760 --> 07:52.500
We already have the Yao Water.

07:53.030 --> 07:54.170
Next,

07:54.500 --> 07:57.080
we should get a piece of the Divine Wood as soon as possible.

07:57.080 --> 07:59.090
But where can we find it?

07:59.670 --> 08:00.390
I guess

08:00.470 --> 08:01.510
the key to finding it

08:01.510 --> 08:02.730
is your mother,

08:02.830 --> 08:03.790
Lord Bai Yan.

08:03.960 --> 08:04.800
My mother?

08:06.470 --> 08:08.260
Great Demon once said

08:08.360 --> 08:10.700
your mother is the descendant of the Divine Tree of Jianmu.

08:10.700 --> 08:12.980
Her true form is also a piece of the Divine Wood.

08:12.980 --> 08:14.080
So in my opinion,

08:14.390 --> 08:17.480
since the Baize Token is made of a piece of the Divine Wood,

08:17.480 --> 08:19.330
maybe your mother's true form

08:19.360 --> 08:21.280
can repair the Baize Token.

08:21.670 --> 08:22.510
But…

08:23.630 --> 08:24.430
What's wrong?

08:30.880 --> 08:33.210
The Divine Tree of Jianmu and the White Emperor Tower

08:33.210 --> 08:34.270
were destroyed

08:34.270 --> 08:35.990
by the Nine-legged Golden Crow 500 years ago.

08:35.990 --> 08:36.610
After that,

08:36.610 --> 08:39.350
two unknown great demons appeared in the Wilderness.

08:39.350 --> 08:41.570
They used their demonic power and blood oaths

08:41.570 --> 08:44.310
to repair the Divine Tree of Jianmu and the White Emperor Tower.

08:44.310 --> 08:45.880
But after the Baize Token disappeared,

08:45.880 --> 08:48.220
the Divine Tree of Jianmu withered.

08:48.330 --> 08:49.930
The Divine Tree of Jianmu now

08:52.010 --> 08:54.070
is just something immortal but dead.

09:00.110 --> 09:01.590
Immortal but dead?

09:02.510 --> 09:03.310
Yes.

09:05.190 --> 09:07.720
The Divine Tree of Jianmu has been destroyed.

09:07.950 --> 09:09.770
Your mother's true form

09:09.980 --> 09:11.510
is naturally lifeless too.

09:16.670 --> 09:17.480
So,

09:18.150 --> 09:20.110
Lord Bai Yan

09:20.310 --> 09:22.670
needs the Baize Token's power

09:22.830 --> 09:25.310
to transform from her true form into Jiu's mother.

09:25.310 --> 09:26.790
Repairing the Baize Token

09:26.790 --> 09:29.990
needs Lord Bai Yan's true form, a piece of the Divine Wood.

09:31.090 --> 09:32.510
Isn't this a dead end?

09:35.700 --> 09:36.940
Is the Wilderness

09:38.170 --> 09:39.630
destined to be destroyed?

09:44.920 --> 09:46.130
Is Great Demon...

09:49.680 --> 09:51.840
really going to be...

10:23.750 --> 10:24.440
I have an idea!

10:24.440 --> 10:25.240
I have an idea!

10:27.050 --> 10:27.720
I have an idea!

10:27.720 --> 10:29.120
I've come up with an idea!

10:29.380 --> 10:30.190
I have a way!

10:30.230 --> 10:30.810
What is it?

10:30.810 --> 10:31.370
No.

10:31.590 --> 10:32.510
It's not that I have a way.

10:32.510 --> 10:33.710
It's Jiu who has a way.

10:34.390 --> 10:35.330
What on earth is going on?

10:35.330 --> 10:36.110
Leave it.

10:36.110 --> 10:36.710
Let's go!

10:36.730 --> 10:37.190
Hurry!

10:38.050 --> 10:39.030
This way.

10:39.060 --> 10:39.710
Be careful.

10:39.710 --> 10:40.670
The floor is wet.

10:40.770 --> 10:41.680
Let's go.

10:41.750 --> 10:42.360
Jiu!

10:43.310 --> 10:43.830
What?

10:43.950 --> 10:44.550
Me?

10:44.710 --> 10:45.510
That's right.

10:45.590 --> 10:46.470
You.

10:46.910 --> 10:48.630
Back in Lingxi Villa,

10:48.660 --> 10:49.920
we needed the cypress that can ward off the plague

10:49.920 --> 10:51.350
as the enhancing ingredient.

10:51.350 --> 10:52.550
But the cypress

10:52.550 --> 10:53.610
withered long ago.

10:53.800 --> 10:55.080
Jiu, your blood

10:55.110 --> 10:56.710
accidentally dripped on it.

10:57.290 --> 10:59.170
A new bud emerged

10:59.190 --> 11:01.310
from where your blood dripped.

11:12.310 --> 11:13.490
I see.

11:13.630 --> 11:15.730
Jiu has the blood

11:15.870 --> 11:17.350
of the human, god, and demon clans.

11:17.350 --> 11:18.830
It is the unique lineage

11:18.850 --> 11:20.260
that grants Jiu's blood

11:20.470 --> 11:21.590
the power

11:21.590 --> 11:23.030
to revive all things.

11:25.850 --> 11:26.850
What do you think?

11:26.940 --> 11:28.580
My idea is awesome, right?

11:54.270 --> 11:55.370
I, Zhuo Yichen,

11:55.400 --> 11:56.740
swear to Heaven

11:57.270 --> 11:58.450
that as long as Zhu Yan

11:58.450 --> 12:01.290
teaches me the true way to use the Cloud Light Sword,

12:01.290 --> 12:04.120
I will surely slay him with my sword.

12:05.860 --> 12:07.150
If I break this oath,

12:07.380 --> 12:09.210
may Heaven and Earth destroy me,

12:09.710 --> 12:11.110
and my soul be scattered.

12:25.670 --> 12:26.630
Here, Jiu.

13:07.550 --> 13:08.550
I did it.

13:09.970 --> 13:11.040
Great Demon can be saved!

13:11.040 --> 13:11.840
Great!

13:14.700 --> 13:16.020
Jiu, you're amazing.

13:18.110 --> 13:18.950
What about me?

13:19.630 --> 13:21.200
Shouldn't you praise me?

13:23.710 --> 13:25.120
Mountain God Ying Lei,

13:25.150 --> 13:26.390
you're amazing too.

13:29.710 --> 13:30.510
Mountain God?

13:31.800 --> 13:33.460
He omitted the word "Little"?

13:49.870 --> 13:50.830
Wen Xiao,

13:51.070 --> 13:51.870
what's wrong?

13:54.870 --> 13:56.530
The Divine Wood is like water.

13:56.830 --> 13:58.690
It takes 100 years to grow leaves,

13:59.910 --> 14:01.350
100 years to bloom,

14:02.710 --> 14:04.110
and 100 years to fruit.

14:07.310 --> 14:08.970
Only the trunk of a Divine Tree

14:10.780 --> 14:13.370
over 300 years old can repair the Baize Token.

14:17.350 --> 14:19.310
I don't think this new bud

14:21.200 --> 14:22.400
can...

14:23.160 --> 14:24.250
save him.

14:26.990 --> 14:28.070
300 years?

14:29.350 --> 14:31.310
How can we wait 300 years?

14:42.770 --> 14:43.770
Maybe...

14:44.950 --> 14:47.210
he can't even make it through three days.

15:24.480 --> 15:26.500
Protect the Wilderness

15:27.600 --> 15:29.140
till the end

15:30.220 --> 15:31.470
of your life.

15:51.120 --> 15:52.390
You still want to

15:52.420 --> 15:54.190
go to Archives at this hour?

15:55.190 --> 15:57.140
Zhao Yuanzhou is suffering

15:57.170 --> 15:58.700
every second now.

16:00.320 --> 16:02.620
I must find another way.

16:09.640 --> 16:13.540
♫The little city traps♫

16:13.570 --> 16:15.760
♫The little us♫

16:15.850 --> 16:19.020
♫Going around and around♫

16:19.260 --> 16:20.760
♫Dusk and dawn♫

16:21.960 --> 16:23.990
♫The heavy door♫

16:24.420 --> 16:27.980
♫Who is waiting foolishly♫

16:28.070 --> 16:33.630
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

16:34.420 --> 16:36.480
♫The pillow of the past♫

16:36.790 --> 16:40.330
♫Still has the warmth of the dream♫

16:40.440 --> 16:42.680
♫The dust from yesterday♫

16:42.930 --> 16:45.520
♫Covering my eyes♫

16:46.740 --> 16:48.700
♫The person in the dream♫

16:49.040 --> 16:52.590
♫Is silent, waiting with each step♫

16:52.880 --> 16:56.200
♫Refuses to leave, and refuses♫

16:56.220 --> 16:57.760
♫To turn around♫

16:58.920 --> 17:02.590
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

17:02.870 --> 17:04.980
♫Many stories♫

17:05.290 --> 17:09.640
♫There's a name in her heart♫

17:11.329 --> 17:12.660
♫The human world♫

17:12.750 --> 17:14.990
♫The ink is mottled♫

17:15.160 --> 17:17.300
♫Love, hate, absurdity, mistakes♫

17:17.400 --> 17:18.780
♫Can't clearly write it♫

17:19.030 --> 17:20.240
♫Can't completely express it♫

17:20.569 --> 17:22.950
♫This karma♫

17:58.110 --> 18:00.550
Mr. Zhuo, you delivered supper yourself.

18:02.430 --> 18:04.380
If the servants find out,

18:04.750 --> 18:06.550
I guess they'll faint from fear.

18:10.820 --> 18:12.490
Pei Sijing told me

18:12.780 --> 18:14.380
you didn't even have dinner.

18:16.270 --> 18:18.070
I made stewed snow pears for you.

18:19.870 --> 18:21.070
Eat it while it's hot.

18:32.770 --> 18:34.240
Where are you going?

18:56.050 --> 18:58.250
I'm going to turn up the oil lamp for you,

18:59.750 --> 19:01.550
so that you can see more clearly.

19:13.700 --> 19:15.230
What are you worried about?

19:17.000 --> 19:18.930
Are you worried that I'll kill him?

19:21.190 --> 19:22.720
It's useless to be worried.

19:28.350 --> 19:29.750
I know in the end,

19:32.200 --> 19:33.500
you will.

19:38.020 --> 19:38.590
Yes.

19:44.320 --> 19:46.250
If in the end,

19:47.280 --> 19:49.480
his malicious energy is out of control,

19:49.830 --> 19:51.030
and he loses his mind,

19:55.940 --> 19:56.910
I will.

20:24.510 --> 20:25.550
I once was

20:27.210 --> 20:28.820
as determined as you.

20:32.990 --> 20:34.710
But now,

20:36.640 --> 20:38.370
I've realized I can't do that.

20:43.450 --> 20:45.010
I still want to save him.

20:47.910 --> 20:49.300
I don't want him to die.

21:14.230 --> 21:15.390
I've already

21:15.690 --> 21:17.330
cleaned it.

21:19.190 --> 21:20.190
It's okay.

21:28.590 --> 21:30.050
You should wipe your face.

21:47.320 --> 21:48.470
The Demon Hunting Bureau

21:48.470 --> 21:50.890
has stopped looking for Zhao Yuanzhou.

21:51.070 --> 21:54.000
Looks like they already know where Zhao Yuanzhou is.

21:55.800 --> 21:58.310
It's time to put some pressure on them,

21:58.790 --> 22:01.070
so that Zhao Yuanzhou can have nowhere to hide.

22:01.070 --> 22:01.970
Don't worry.

22:02.260 --> 22:03.590
This time,

22:03.610 --> 22:06.140
Zhao Yuanzhou is within our grasp.

22:33.360 --> 22:35.850
Is it painful?

22:39.540 --> 22:41.030
I don't mind.

22:46.040 --> 22:48.250
Demons want to become humans.

22:49.110 --> 22:51.720
Humans want to become immortals.

22:53.400 --> 22:55.450
But immortals are unmoved

22:57.350 --> 22:58.600
by love.

23:23.350 --> 23:24.470
The Chongwu Camp has reported

23:24.470 --> 23:26.150
Zhao Yuanzhou's loss of control and escape

23:26.150 --> 23:27.410
to King Xiang.

23:27.670 --> 23:29.000
King Xiang was furious.

23:29.060 --> 23:30.200
This morning, he ordered us

23:30.200 --> 23:32.330
to arrest Zhao Yuanzhou immediately.

23:33.500 --> 23:37.040
Otherwise, everyone in the Demon Hunting Bureau will be beheaded.

23:37.040 --> 23:38.110
Mr. Zhuo,

23:39.030 --> 23:40.770
we can't delay any longer.

23:42.720 --> 23:43.560
Okay.

23:44.590 --> 23:45.630
Got it.

23:46.550 --> 23:47.370
Father.

23:49.070 --> 23:50.190
Zhuo.

24:13.470 --> 24:14.480
Zhuo!

24:15.180 --> 24:16.160
Zhuo!

24:32.470 --> 24:33.600
Zhuo!

25:16.650 --> 25:19.220
Stop thinking about her.

25:20.590 --> 25:22.950
You are not qualified.

25:27.360 --> 25:30.150
You killed her master with your own hands.

25:32.350 --> 25:35.910
Do you still think you can be with her?

25:38.090 --> 25:42.570
You killed Zhuo Yichen's father and brother with your own hands.

25:43.990 --> 25:45.270
Do you still expect him

25:45.270 --> 25:48.350
to show you mercy?

25:49.230 --> 25:51.590
What are you still hoping for?

25:51.760 --> 25:53.470
Give up.

25:54.250 --> 25:56.250
Look at yourself.

25:57.110 --> 25:59.150
And look at me.

26:01.150 --> 26:02.700
Embrace me.

26:03.150 --> 26:04.650
Embrace me!

26:04.790 --> 26:05.550
Shut up!

26:58.200 --> 26:59.260
Mr. Zhuo.

27:01.950 --> 27:03.210
I'm here to see you off.

27:11.870 --> 27:13.800
Little Mountain God, you've been in the mortal world for a long time.

27:13.800 --> 27:15.670
I didn't expect you to be so familiar

27:15.670 --> 27:17.190
with our customs and etiquette.

27:17.190 --> 27:18.600
Your customs?

27:18.710 --> 27:19.510
Yes.

27:20.260 --> 27:22.260
Soldiers would drink wine

27:22.310 --> 27:23.840
before they go into battle.

27:24.070 --> 27:26.570
First, it's to inspire the heroes

27:27.110 --> 27:29.220
and wish for their early triumphant return.

27:29.220 --> 27:30.320
Second?

27:32.750 --> 27:34.260
Second...

27:35.650 --> 27:37.460
if the heroes can never return,

27:39.520 --> 27:41.850
This will be the last farewell drink.

27:45.500 --> 27:47.030
On the annual memorial day,

27:48.280 --> 27:49.640
you can spill wine to commemorate us.

27:49.640 --> 27:50.650
God forbid.

27:50.870 --> 27:53.200
Just pretend I never asked this question.

27:53.550 --> 27:54.350
Mr. Zhuo.

27:54.350 --> 27:55.030
Here's the pomegranate flower wine

27:55.030 --> 27:56.620
I brewed myself.

27:57.040 --> 27:58.630
I put the Mountain God's blessings in it.

27:58.630 --> 27:59.850
It can strengthen your body

27:59.850 --> 28:01.160
and replenish your spiritual energy.

28:01.160 --> 28:03.160
I want you and Great Demon to have it.

28:07.830 --> 28:09.760
So you also miss Great Demon.

28:12.600 --> 28:14.200
I just wonder

28:14.220 --> 28:15.630
how he's doing now,

28:16.990 --> 28:18.520
and if he's feeling unwell.

28:19.950 --> 28:21.820
I hope he can remain sensible.

28:22.180 --> 28:23.690
I hope that when we meet again,

28:23.690 --> 28:25.420
we can sit down and have a drink.

28:26.220 --> 28:29.420
Then it'll be worth it, having met each other in this life.

28:32.090 --> 28:33.910
Let's have a drink first.

28:37.050 --> 28:37.790
Let me.

28:42.310 --> 28:44.970
I've never had a drink with you before, Mr. Zhuo.

28:45.550 --> 28:46.820
I never thought

28:46.850 --> 28:48.710
the first time would be like this.

29:06.310 --> 29:07.560
It seems

29:08.830 --> 29:10.630
he and I never had a chance

29:10.650 --> 29:12.450
to have a drink properly either.

29:33.210 --> 29:35.050
If I don't make it back,

29:36.780 --> 29:38.660
please give this

29:38.690 --> 29:39.890
to Wen Xiao.

29:39.920 --> 29:41.000
No, no.

29:41.290 --> 29:42.340
Mr. Zhuo.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.950
You must come back safely,

29:43.770 --> 29:47.620
♫Footsteps echo, one by one♫

29:45.200 --> 29:46.000
and give this

29:46.060 --> 29:47.850
to the Goddess personally.

29:48.230 --> 29:51.080
♫Sorrows scattered, lost to the wind♫

29:48.250 --> 29:48.910
I can't do you

29:48.910 --> 29:49.670
this favor.

29:52.510 --> 29:56.330
♫Not forgetting, nor dwelling on♫

29:56.710 --> 29:59.560
♫The way back home♫

30:00.270 --> 30:01.940
♫With strong will♫

30:00.460 --> 30:01.520
Are you leaving?

30:02.300 --> 30:05.870
♫I slowly carve out♫

30:03.820 --> 30:04.830
Take the wine.

30:06.320 --> 30:07.240
Come on.

30:06.420 --> 30:08.220
♫Growth♫

30:08.770 --> 30:10.360
♫Turning back♫

30:10.980 --> 30:14.240
♫I find you still in that familiar place♫

30:15.030 --> 30:16.710
♫Waiting there♫

30:29.150 --> 30:30.900
Don't be sad for me.

30:32.050 --> 30:33.640
The dead demons

30:34.180 --> 30:36.340
will become the sun, moon, and stars.

30:37.600 --> 30:39.320
I can also turn into rain.

30:41.020 --> 30:42.790
From now on, whenever it rains,

30:46.580 --> 30:48.710
it'll be me coming to keep you company.

30:56.730 --> 30:59.480
You kept talking about dying.

31:00.710 --> 31:01.860
See?

31:03.590 --> 31:06.650
Good wishes never come true, while bad omens always do.

31:06.850 --> 31:08.590
God is also unhappy about it.

31:19.980 --> 31:21.040
Sister Wen.

31:28.490 --> 31:29.750
Where is Brother Zhuo?

31:29.750 --> 31:31.140
I thought he was here.

31:32.380 --> 31:33.830
He has set off.

31:39.870 --> 31:41.470
Although Great Demon...

31:41.890 --> 31:43.190
Wow!

31:43.800 --> 31:44.350
Wow!

31:44.380 --> 31:46.230
Although he used to scare me a lot,

31:46.230 --> 31:48.940
after being together every day these days,

31:50.830 --> 31:51.750
it seems

31:53.280 --> 31:55.540
I've become used to having him by my side.

31:56.230 --> 31:58.130
So in this world,

31:58.590 --> 31:59.750
the scariest thing

32:00.920 --> 32:02.510
is to get used to something.

32:04.570 --> 32:06.290
If only I could put

32:06.860 --> 32:09.410
what happened between me and Great Demon

32:09.780 --> 32:12.060
into Cheng Huang's sundial.

32:13.570 --> 32:14.660
This way,

32:15.830 --> 32:17.430
when I miss him,

32:18.840 --> 32:20.500
I'll have memories to look at.

32:32.110 --> 32:32.950
The sundial.

32:38.490 --> 32:39.450
The sundial?

32:40.160 --> 32:40.830
Yes.

32:45.330 --> 32:46.470
In that case,

32:46.710 --> 32:48.970
the sundial can not only store memories,

32:49.470 --> 32:50.950
but also stop time.

32:51.780 --> 32:52.830
That's right.

32:54.340 --> 32:55.680
So if someone

32:55.950 --> 32:57.190
brings the branches of the Divine Wood

32:57.190 --> 32:58.710
into the Time Valley,

32:58.870 --> 33:01.050
waits for the Divine Wood to bloom,

33:01.150 --> 33:02.630
takes its branches down

33:03.030 --> 33:04.700
300 years later

33:04.880 --> 33:06.710
and takes them out of the Time Valley,

33:06.710 --> 33:08.910
the Baize Token can be repaired, right?

33:10.920 --> 33:12.190
Mr. Lu Wu.

33:12.350 --> 33:13.790
Is this method feasible?

33:14.750 --> 33:15.550
Yes.

33:17.070 --> 33:20.170
But I must remind you, Goddess.

33:20.510 --> 33:21.790
When time stops,

33:21.810 --> 33:23.270
days will wear on like years.

33:23.270 --> 33:24.990
It'll be like an infinite torment.

33:24.990 --> 33:26.420
As for the hardship it brings,

33:26.420 --> 33:28.440
you must think it through.

33:39.810 --> 33:40.910
But

33:40.940 --> 33:43.400
hasn't the sundial already been destroyed?

33:47.450 --> 33:48.680
The one that was destroyed

33:48.680 --> 33:49.870
was just a paperweight

33:49.870 --> 33:51.760
I accidentally took from your room.

33:51.760 --> 33:54.060
I still have the real sundial.

34:13.489 --> 34:14.210
Wow.

34:16.940 --> 34:18.219
Impressive.

34:19.060 --> 34:20.610
Don't worry, Goddess.

34:21.100 --> 34:22.090
I will

34:22.120 --> 34:23.070
always be here.

34:25.210 --> 34:26.270
Sister Wen.

34:26.690 --> 34:27.400
Take care.

34:37.909 --> 34:39.170
I'll wait for you here.

35:47.430 --> 35:47.990
Hey.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.240
How much longer

35:49.310 --> 35:50.640
do you think it'll take?

35:51.500 --> 35:51.990
Well.

35:52.520 --> 35:53.540
It should be soon.

36:13.610 --> 36:14.030
Hey.

36:14.030 --> 36:14.670
She's out.

36:19.510 --> 36:20.580
Sister Wen.

36:21.620 --> 36:22.760
How are you?

36:22.810 --> 36:23.880
Was it tough?

36:28.330 --> 36:29.760
300 years.

36:30.830 --> 36:32.250
It was indeed tough.

36:34.480 --> 36:37.580
I finally understood

36:38.030 --> 36:40.830
what Mountain God Lu Wu meant by infinite torment.

36:45.370 --> 36:46.540
But fortunately,

36:46.630 --> 36:47.950
I got it.

36:48.390 --> 36:49.380
Great.

36:49.470 --> 36:51.330
We can repair the Baize Token now.

36:51.470 --> 36:52.250
Let’s go.

36:52.320 --> 36:53.550
Let's go save Great Demon right away.

36:53.550 --> 36:55.490
Mr. Zhuo has been on the road for most of the day.

36:55.490 --> 36:57.210
Can we still make it?

36:57.240 --> 36:58.600
Yes.

36:59.100 --> 37:00.430
Actually, Zhuo and I

37:00.990 --> 37:02.280
have made a plan.

37:09.740 --> 37:11.130
What is this?

37:11.430 --> 37:13.460
This is the Soul Trapping Needle

37:13.990 --> 37:15.250
Jiu gave me last night.

37:16.590 --> 37:17.550
Jiu said

37:17.980 --> 37:19.080
this silver needle

37:19.140 --> 37:20.880
was soaked

37:20.980 --> 37:21.950
in the suspended animation decoction

37:21.950 --> 37:23.480
made from Death Ginseng and Kusnezoff Monkshood Root.

37:23.480 --> 37:24.450
It can make people

37:24.450 --> 37:25.760
lose all vital signs

37:25.970 --> 37:28.650
and make them enter a state of suspended animation.

37:28.650 --> 37:30.180
Soul Trapping Needle?

37:31.110 --> 37:32.770
As long as we put this needle in

37:32.910 --> 37:34.910
between Zhao Yuanzhou's eyebrows,

37:37.200 --> 37:39.000
he will paralyze and faint

37:39.300 --> 37:41.470
and enter the state of suspended animation.

37:41.470 --> 37:42.270
Meanwhile,

37:42.870 --> 37:44.190
the malicious energy in him

37:44.190 --> 37:45.430
can be controlled.

37:47.110 --> 37:48.170
This way, we can also

37:48.170 --> 37:49.970
give King Xiang an explanation.

37:54.180 --> 37:56.110
After the Baize Token is repaired,

37:56.440 --> 37:58.080
we can take this needle out

37:59.000 --> 38:00.620
and awaken Zhao Yuanzhou.

38:08.210 --> 38:09.670
Jiu is really thoughtful.

38:11.470 --> 38:12.490
Zhuo.

38:15.710 --> 38:16.800
You too.

38:27.680 --> 38:29.220
That's great.

38:29.750 --> 38:31.940
It's lucky that you and Mr. Zhuo had a discussion.

38:31.940 --> 38:34.280
When I bid farewell to Mr. Zhuo,

38:34.550 --> 38:35.670
I was so sad.

38:37.980 --> 38:39.190
Sister Wen.

38:39.390 --> 38:40.920
What are you talking about?

38:41.380 --> 38:42.730
Soul Trapping Needle?

38:43.350 --> 38:44.490
What Soul Trapping Needle?

38:44.490 --> 38:46.920
I've been sleeping at home last night.

38:47.030 --> 38:48.690
I never went to see Mr. Zhuo,

38:48.710 --> 38:49.630
nor did I ever develop

38:49.630 --> 38:50.910
that thing you said.

38:58.560 --> 39:00.160
There's no smell of sulphur.

39:00.490 --> 39:01.990
So you are the real Jiu.

39:02.590 --> 39:03.450
There must be something wrong

39:03.450 --> 39:04.810
with Mr. Zhuo.

39:04.990 --> 39:07.350
How could there be something wrong with Mr. Zhuo?

39:07.350 --> 39:08.970
You must be out of your mind.

39:08.990 --> 39:10.190
Wake up.

39:10.190 --> 39:11.510
Wake up. Think about it.

39:11.510 --> 39:12.960
When we were chasing Ao Yin,

39:12.960 --> 39:13.950
she had already been poisoned

39:13.950 --> 39:15.020
by the Huanling Powder mixed with Kusnezoff Monkshood Root.

39:15.020 --> 39:15.990
Her speed had already been reduced.

39:15.990 --> 39:18.390
What did that brat spill on me?

39:18.390 --> 39:20.060
Why am I so slow?

39:20.320 --> 39:21.910
Given how agile Mr. Zhuo is,

39:22.000 --> 39:24.110
he shouldn't have failed to catch her.

39:24.110 --> 39:24.970
Where is Ao Yin?

39:26.760 --> 39:28.160
She got away.

39:30.450 --> 39:32.840
It does seem a bit strange.

39:35.330 --> 39:37.820
Ao Yin pretended to be me and killed the Prime Minister.

39:37.820 --> 39:40.420
I always felt that she must have taken orders from someone.

39:40.420 --> 39:41.850
Our guess is

39:42.040 --> 39:44.100
Ao Yin answers to Li Lun.

39:45.130 --> 39:46.050
Could it be...

39:47.620 --> 39:48.280
Yes.

39:52.570 --> 39:54.060
You mean

39:55.320 --> 39:56.890
Li Lun is not dead?

39:59.120 --> 40:00.770
Where would he be?

40:02.830 --> 40:04.020
He might be

40:04.590 --> 40:06.680
possessing someone right now.
